mods/omarchy-voice/voice.js follows the dictation flow of Shepherdr's chat mod
(mods/chat/dictate.js, MIT License): the recording state machine, the whisper.cpp flags
(-l auto -nt -np) and the clean-up of whisper's silence and noise markers. The recorder
(ffmpeg with AVFoundation instead of pw-record) and the paste into terminals are new.
pasteboard.jxa (whole-clipboard save and restore) is new.
mic.svg is Lucide's "mic" icon (ISC License).
